extras/9530ce30a5639edd6f7731bdedd8b807.avif?t=1763051857\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some powerful Equipment requires a specific Sequence of colored balls to activate its attributes. Once active, your cues can transform into superweapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(In the Demo, the maximum level is capped, restricting some high-level items. The full version removes this limit.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/extras/fba7ecb1479f46780534b34435452046.poster.avif?t=1763051857\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/extras/fba7ecb1479f46780534b34435452046.webm?t=1763051857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/extras/fba7ecb1479f46780534b34435452046.mp4?t=1763051857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/extras/f029645ed7e58b28cf5793816630d6f7.avif?t=1763051857\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 100 unique cues and pieces of equipment, combining them to form countless combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the standard white cue ball, discover a range of unexpected and unique cue balls to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your backpack is stocked with powerful cues and equipment, and your pockets hold the perfect Pocket Hand, sit back and immerse yourself in a spectacular audio-visual fireworks show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The Demo offers 3 unique cue balls, with the full version unlocking all.)</p>","developers":["Zodiac GameLab"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1890630","name":"Billiard of Chaos"