b96548ead998.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763051857","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/8e04a4a83799b7a4f2016bda2abab96548ead998/ss_8e04a4a83799b7a4f2016bda2abab96548ead998.600x338.jpg?t=1763051857"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/f0214f23a5aef39b974ec98dd1cc4e2e5d7cff52/ss_f0214f23a5aef39b974ec98dd1cc4e2e5d7cff52.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763051857","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/f0214f23a5aef39b974ec98dd1cc4e2e5d7cff52/ss_f0214f23a5aef39b974ec98dd1cc4e2e5d7cff52.600x338.jpg?t=1763051857"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/928542d379e6499e5fbed68e5bace21445902dd0/ss_928542d379e6499e5fbed68e5bace21445902dd0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763051857","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063070/928542d379e6499e5fbed68e5bace21445902dd0/ss_928542d379e6499e5fbed68e5bace21445902dd0.600x338.jpg?t=1763051857"}],"short_description":"Billiard of Chaos is a thrilling and laid-back roguelike. No aiming, no dodging\u2014just set your cue, max out your Mult, and unleash a spectacular firework show. Shatter red balls in a storm of vibrant shots and watch your Score skyrocket. What could be more satisfying?","steam_appid":4063070,"support_info":{"email":"ZodiacGameLab@hotmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Finnish, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, French, German","type":"demo","website":null}